{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51208","headline":"五言白话诗 十五 · 缺名","name":"五言白话诗 十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奴人赐酒食，恩言出义气。\n（「奴」，项楚校作「好」。\n「义」，蒋绍愚校作「美」。\n）无赖不与钱，蛆心打脊使。\n贫穷实可怜，饥寒肚露地。\n户役一槩差，不辧棒下死。\n可出头坐，谁肯被鞭耻。\n何爲抛宅走，良由不得止。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缺名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51208.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51208","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}